  "keyFeatures": [
    "AI voice agents that conduct form interviews over phone calls",
    "Six configurable question types: string, number, date, boolean, single-select, multi-select",
    "Conditional branching — ask follow-up groups only when triggered by earlier answers",
    "Per-question validation rules (phone numbers, date ranges, regex, natural-language rules)",
    "Configurable retry behaviour per question with custom retry messages",
    "Screening questions that end calls early via end_call_values",
    "WebRTC-based call embedding for integration into your own web page",
    "Real-time answer polling via GET /data endpoint (no API key required)",
    "Versioned agent history with diff preview and one-click restore",
    "Agent and workspace-level analytics including completion rates, duration, latency, and cost",
    "Multi-user workspaces with per-agent access control",
    "Cross-agent conversation polling for keeping external databases in sync"
  ],
